  po_live_recurrence_20260808T1248Z: "LIVE RECURRENCE, AND THIS TIME IT REACHED GIT. docs/data/auditor-tier1-last-healthy.json currently reads {last_healthy_at: '2026-08-08T12:05:10Z', checks: {... mem_creep: 'PASS' ...}} and was committed at 34521315f by router session 165f4245 on the good-faith premise (quoted from that commit message) that the value is 'a genuine last-all-6-checks-passed timestamp before the mem_creep FAILURE window began'. PO REFUTES THAT PREMISE ON RAW EVIDENCE, three independent ways: (1) the FAILURE window began no later than 2026-08-08T11:04Z — peer auditor cycle c48 (commit 76466302a) records rag-service-1 at 98.53% / 15MiB free / BELOW-FLOOR at that time — so 12:05:10Z is INSIDE the failure window, not before it; (2) PO re-ran the pre-gate read-only at 12:47Z via the documented HEARTBEAT_FILE_PATH=<scratch> seam and got verdict=FAILURE, detail 'mem_creep: ... vn-market-intelligence-mcp-rag-service-1(98.56%, 14.7MiB-free, BELOW-FLOOR(floor=40MiB))', with the container at RestartCount=0 / OOMKilled=false / healthy / StartedAt 2026-08-08T08:11:45Z — i.e. no restart between 11:04Z and now that could have produced a transient green at 12:05Z; (3) the shell pre-gate STRUCTURALLY CANNOT have written it: run_probe() gates _write_heartbeat on an EMPTY failures list, and _mem_container_acked() disqualifies the rag-service acked_memory entry twice over — headroom 15MiB < MEM_FLOOR_MIB=40 -> BELOW-FLOOR, and tracked_by=FU-RAG-DEPLOY-MEMORY reached DONE_VERIFIED at 10:59:52Z -> STALE-ACK. Therefore the 12:05:10Z stamp is an out-of-contract agent write on a DEGRADED cycle — exactly this row's defect — and it is now the committed record. IMPACT beyond this row's existing scope: the tier-1 cron freshness arm reads .last_healthy_at and spawns on age>60min, so a false stamp suppresses that arm for an hour (the verdict=FAILURE arm still fires, so this is degradation, not blindness). REMEDIATION IS NOT PO'S TO EXECUTE: hand-writing this file is explicitly forbidden (pre-commit hook scripts/git-hooks/pre-commit:119 names _write_heartbeat as the sole authorized writer, and the 2026-07-29 PO constraint on scripts/po-s151-tier1-probe-plane-divergence-triage.jq:83 says 'Do NOT hand-write docs/data/auditor-tier1-last-healthy.json'). Correct action, for router/ops: revert the file half of 34521315f so the field returns to its last genuinely-green value 2026-08-07T03:35:32Z (written by b30e533ce), which restores the honest >33h-stale reading and lets the freshness arm work. Do NOT re-stamp it forward by hand."
